PRIVACY POLICY

App: Durant Dev (PR) (the "App")
Operated by: P R Enterprises (contact person: Nikhil)
Effective date: 26 November 2026

Durant Dev (PR) ("we", "us", "our") operates the App, which helps shopkeepers, EDLI center operators and other business buyers browse and order pulses, spices and related grocery items from P R Enterprises. This policy explains what information we collect, why we collect it, and how it is used and protected.


1. INFORMATION WE COLLECT

1.1 Information you give us

- Name and mobile number: to create your account, log you in, and contact you about orders.
- Shop or business name (optional): to identify your business on orders.
- Profile or shop photo (optional): to show on your profile.
- Delivery addresses and map pin location: to deliver your orders and calculate delivery charges.
- Order details (items, quantities, prices, status, history): to process, deliver and show your orders.

1.2 Information collected through the App

- Precise location: only when you tap the GPS button or use the map to set a delivery location. We do not track your location in the background. You can deny this permission and type or search for your address instead.
- Notification token: if you enable notifications, a device token is created by Firebase Cloud Messaging and saved with your account so we can send order updates. You can turn notifications off in the App (Profile) or in your phone settings.
- Data stored on your device: the App keeps your cart, wishlist and a cache of products and orders on your device so it loads faster. This stays on your device.

1.3 What we do not collect

We do not access your contacts, camera, microphone or files. We do not show ads, and we do not use advertising IDs. We do not sell your personal information.


2. HOW WE USE YOUR INFORMATION

- Create and manage your account.
- Send your order to P R Enterprises for approval and processing.
- Deliver orders to the correct location and calculate delivery charges.
- Send order status updates and important notices by push notification.
- Provide customer support and keep the App working.


3. LOGIN AND ACCOUNT APPROVAL

You register with your name and 10-digit mobile number. Later you log in with the same mobile number; no password or one-time code is required at present. Because of this, please keep your device and mobile number secure and tell us immediately if your number is lost or compromised. Ordering may be enabled only after your account is approved by P R Enterprises.


4. SERVICES WE USE AND DATA SHARING

We do not sell or rent your personal data. We share limited data only as needed to run the App:

- Google Firebase (Firebase Cloud Messaging): to deliver push notifications. Privacy policy: https://policies.google.com/privacy
- OpenStreetMap services (Nominatim and map tiles) and Photon (Komoot): to show maps and to search or look up addresses. When you pick a location or search for a place, the coordinates or search text are sent to these services.
- Our hosting provider (Railway): where our server and database run.
- Delivery staff: they receive your name, phone number, address and order details to fulfil your order.
- Authorities: if required by law.


5. SECURITY

Data is sent between the App and our server over encrypted (HTTPS) connections and stored on our server with reasonable safeguards. No method of electronic storage is completely secure, so we cannot guarantee absolute security.


